:: OC Kazu Intro 2 [nobr]

/* Intro */
The rest of the class goes by in complete silence from the students; <span style="color:LightCoral">everyone so afraid and nervous about what the furious <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Randolph</span> did to <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Kazu</span> that they are unable to speak.</span> You can’t tell if this makes it easier or harder to pay attention, but it does make you nearly jump out of your skin <span style="color:Yellow">when <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Randolph</span> harshly calls you to the front of the class as the bell rings.</span> <br>

