<span style="color:LightSteelBlue">“<span style="color:DarkTurquoise">$Player.LastName</span>.”</span> He says, the words alone making your rear sting from anticipation. Your mind is abuzz of what you could have possibly done wrong to earn his ire when he suddenly hands you a small piece of paper. <span style="color:LightSteelBlue">“Could you please deliver this to the nurse’s office please, for <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Mr. Igwe</span>.”</span> You glance at the paper and see it is a write-up labeled <span style="color:LightSteelBlue">“<span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Kazuyuki Igwe</span>”</span>, you assume this is <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Kazu</span>’s full name. <span style="color:LightGreen">You feel a wave of relief wash over you as you realize you aren’t in trouble.</span> <span style="color:LightSteelBlue">“If he’s not in the nurse’s, check the front office. He may be there getting chewed out since this is already his 5th write-up from my class.”</span> <br>
<br>
You agree and quickly exit the classroom, still fearful that <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Mr. Randolph</span> will suddenly explode from anger due to some random movement or comment you make. You are only able to calm your nerves once you are far from the classroom. <span style="color:Pink">Based on how red his butt looked after that spanking, you figured he’d still be in the infirmary and walk in to find <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Dr. Bertram</span> leaning over a face-down <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Kazu</span>. A curtain has been slightly drawn, but it doesn’t cover much, and you blush as you spy that the boy’s bottoms and underwear have been pulled down to his knees, revealing his still bright red and pulsing butt.</span> <br>

