<span style="color:LightSteelBlue">“You must have really done it this time.”</span> <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Bertram</span> sighs. He is applying white cream to <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Kazu</span>’s rear, most likely something to help numb or ease the pain. <span style="color:LightSteelBlue">“<span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Randolph</span> only goes this hard when you REALLY piss him off. Would it kill you to just pay attention in class and not talk back?”</span> <br>
<br>
<span style="color:LightSteelBlue">“Yeah, it probably would- Ow!”</span> <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Kazu</span> starts to say in a mischievous tone, but is quickly silenced as <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Bertram</span> applies cream to the most painful spot. <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Kazu</span> grumbles to himself blushing, turning his head and suddenly spots you standing at the doorway. He grimaces at you before smirking. <span style="color:LightSteelBlue">“Like what you see, gaywad? Come take a closer look. Maybe rub some cream on it yourself!”</span> He then says something in a foreign language and smirks. While you are not sure exactly what he said, you get the idea it was an insult based on his tone. <br>
<br>
<span style="color:LightSteelBlue">“Language.”</span> <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Dr. Bertram</span> sighs, <span style="color:LightSteelBlue">“We are right next to the office, you know?”</span> <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Kazu</span> rolls his eyes, <span style="color:LightSteelBlue">“Anyway, that should do you for now. Just stay like that for a few seconds to let it dry completely, then you should be good to go. It should allow you to sit in the rest of your classes without too much pain, but please try to refrain from receiving anymore beatings today.”</span> <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Bertram</span> walks back to his desk as <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Kazu</span>, not even waiting for the cream to fully dry, pulls up his bottoms and sits up. <br>
<br>
<span style="color:LightSteelBlue">“What do you want? Other than lookin’ at my ass.”</span> <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Kazu</span> asks, crossing his arms and glaring at you with a smirk. You hand him the write-up and <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Kazu</span>, only giving it a slight glance, quickly crumples it up and tosses it over his shoulder. <span style="color:LightSteelBlue">“Yeah, detention. Got it. Don’t need no fuckin’ reminder. You’d think he'd realize he’s just wastin’ paper at this point.”</span> He yawns loudly, somehow still composed despite the pain he just endured, and looks you up and down. <span style="color:LightSteelBlue">“What are you then, his gopher?”</span> You tell him you were just asked to deliver the paper and <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Kazu</span> chuckles, <span style="color:LightSteelBlue">“So, you’re a goody two-shoes rule-follower then? Whatever, I guess we can’t all be cool.”</span> <br>

