<span style="color:LightSteelBlue">“I’m <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Kazuyuki</span>, but call me <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Kazu</span>.”</span> He surprises you by sticking his hand out, shaking your hand firmly as he introduces himself, <span style="color:LightSteelBlue">“You’re that new kid, right? Look me up if you ever want to have some real fun, unless you’re just a coward.”</span> He laughs, <span style="color:LightSteelBlue">“Oh, and by the way, you dropped somethin’.”</span> <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Kazu</span> points behind you to the ground and you turn around. However, right as you do, <span style="color:Pink"> <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Kazu</span> suddenly grips the back of your $PlayerBottoms.Type and yanks them down to the ground!</span> <br>
